</section>

<!-- Contributing Section -->
<section class="section section-dark section-center">
  <div class="section-inner section-narrow reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">开源社区驱动</h2>
    <p class="section-desc" style="margin:0 auto 32px">AuditAI 采用 MIT 许可证。欢迎安全研究人员和开发者贡献。</p>
